>商数昏末，下民佯狂</em></p> <div class="span"></div> </div> <div class="preview yes"> <p><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/wanderers:the-ballad-that-the-river">国风——河水</a></strong><br /> <em>辞乡征远，河伯夺伊</em></p> <div class="span"></div> </div> <div class="preview yes"> <p><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/nobody-would-sing-the-rhythm-in-the-wing-again-and-again">无人更唱风中曲</a></strong><br /> <em>不信青史，竟忘飞灰</em></p> <div class="span"></div> </div> <div class="preview yes"> <p><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/wanderers:broken-heart">诗钞——破碎之心</a></strong><br /> <em>儿女情长，奈何闺怨</em></p> <div class="span"></div> </div> <div class="preview yes"> <p><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/wanderers:the-poem-that-eternally-wandering-in-paradise-lost">诗钞——乐土长歌行</a></strong><br /> <em>乐土乐土，呜呼哀哉</em></p> <div class="span"></div> </div> <div class="front-title tt-out"> <div class="front-title tt-inner"> <h1><span>╣ 岿阳正道 ╠</span></h1> </div> </div> <div class="preview yes"> <p><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/wanderers:the-scripture-of-ky-that-jin-gong">步虚列仙传——西方行者金公录</a></strong><br /> <em>金公行义，传道西洋</em></p> <div class="span"></div> </div> <div class="preview yes"> <p><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/wanderers:the-magic-code-that-conquer-the-black-dragon">岿阳谶——鹿尘子伏龙还丹诀</a></strong><br /> <em>黑王谶定，调伏毒龙</em></p> <div class="span"></div> </div> <div class="preview yes"> <p><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/wanderers:chun">岿阳诀 —— 碧游春</a></strong><br /> <em>颠之倒之，无我无他</em></p> <div class="span"></div> </div> <div class="front-title tt-out"> <div class="front-title tt-inner"> <h1><span>╣ 虚漠旧史 ╠</span></h1> </div> </div> <div class="preview yes"> <p><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yixue012">异学零壹贰 律召调阳</a></strong><br /> <em>十二律吕，千年兴衰</em></p> <div class="span"></div> </div> <div class="preview yes"> <p><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yixue299">异学贰玖玖 巫山神女</a></strong><br /> <em>